        <headline>High Wind Watch issued September 24 at 12:47AM MDT until September 26 at 9:00AM MDT by NWS Great Falls MT</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...West winds 30 to 35 mph with gusts up to 60 mph possible.

* WHERE...Eastern Glacier, Western Toole, and Central Pondera and
Northern High Plains.

* WHEN...From Friday evening through Saturday morning.

* IMPACTS...Travel could be difficult, especially for high profile
vehicles.
</description>
        <instruction>Remember, a High Wind Watch means that there is at least a 50% chance
of 40 mph sustained winds or 58 mph wind gusts occurring during the
watch period.</instruction>
